{"id":"ff0cb02ba14373e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Tournament","display":"df-zfc-comb6-tournament — ZFC Comb6 Tournament","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-tournament — ZFC Comb6 Tournament","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-tournament — ZFC Comb6 Tournament"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R\\in V\">\\(X,R\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\">\\(R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\)</span>；有序对编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}tournament} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land R\\cap R^{-1}=\\varnothing\\land R\\cup R^{-1}=(X\\times X)\\setminus\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}tournament} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land R\\cap R^{-1}=\\varnothing\\land R\\cup R^{-1}=(X\\times X)\\setminus\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The vertex carrier is named <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, avoiding collision with the universe symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, and the diagonal is bound inside the assertion rather than left as a free parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}$；有序对编码见 [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R^{-1}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,x\\rangle:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}tournament} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb6Tournament}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land R\\cap R^{-1}=\\varnothing\\land R\\cup R^{-1}=(X\\times X)\\setminus\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in X\\}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1682","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament.md|58-df-zfc-comb6-tournament]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f16f4ca5b9c48bbe"]}